  "details": "After Vrchats Update to the website. Someone stole my icon and banner I personally edited and they Ai'ed to make it their own. This is due to the website being able to download the images off icons and banners after the update. Which is a big problem for photo editors, artists and creators. The old Website did have that feature of being able to download it. So if Vrchat can, they should make it so it's not able to click on peoples profile and right click and press download. (No this doesn't mean get rid of pfps and banners off the game.)",
